.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt GENET 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm genet
.Nd RavenBSD Raspberry Pi 4 GENET frame service
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar bar=handle:length dma=handle:length irq=handle irq_pin=number
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
brings up the BCM2711 GENET v5 controller through the
.Xr raven-driver 3
MMIO/DMA/IRQ grants and registers the
.Dq nic:
frame service consumed by
.Xr netd 8 .
It reads the station address from
.Dq plat:mac ,
programs the UMAC/RGMII state and serves the B39 frame ring, the
.Dq nic:info ,
.Dq nic:mac ,
.Dq nic:link ,
.Dq nic:ring ,
.Dq nic:start ,
.Dq nic:stop ,
.Dq nic:release
and
.Dq nic:quit
entries.
.Pp
The
.Dq nic:release
path accepts the DHCP and ping observations used by
.Xr pi4-net-evidence 1
and prints the
.Dq GENET-NET-*
transcript only after the ordered link, DHCP and gateway-ping observations.
.Pp
The devd platform launch that supplies the BAR/DMA/IRQ handles is not wired on the Pi 4
(P8). The release profile stages
.Nm
with its service manifest disabled; no link, DHCP or ping result is claimed until the board
transcript exists.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/services.d/genet.toml -compact
.It Pa /etc/services.d/genet.toml
Service manifest (staged disabled in the Pi 4 release profile).
.It Pa profiles/pi4-release.d/genet.manifest
Release profile manifest.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr devd 8 ,
.Xr netd 8 ,
.Xr platd 8
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
